    "show_share": true,
    "description": "Kenya's current population of approximately \n       54 million  people is predicted to \n       double  by 2050. In contrast to a global trend towards aging economies, Kenya boasts one of the most youthful populations in the world. According to the East Africa Institute's 2019  Whole Youth Development in Kenya Report , the median age of Kenyans is estimated at around 19 years old, where about 78 per cent of the population is under 35 years old.",
